                                "sense_id": "9b8d80d5-d316-32b7-814a-686afef95b02",
                                "text": "Linda Balgord brings bug-eyed hamminess and a bothersome vocal wobble to the role of aging actress Norma Desmond, almost completely missing the textured humor, intelligence, and pathos of Gloria Swanson's great screen performance."
                            },
